READ-OUT
========================================================================================
  Compare rows of comparable SPREAD across the two fixtures, not rows of the same name.
  If the bumps' rho falls toward the saddle's once its dynamic range is cut to match,
  then d=20 feasibility is a statement about the curvature field being ranked, not
  about the teacher -- and it does not transfer to a manifold whose spread is unknown.
